      "zh-Hant": "維爾納·肯普夫（Werner Kempf）1886 年 3 月 9 日生於柯尼斯堡，1964 年 1 月 6 日卒於巴特哈爾茨堡；德國國家圖書館授權檔記其職業為將軍。",
      "en": "Werner Kempf was born on 9 March 1886 in Königsberg and died on 6 January 1964 in Bad Harzburg; the German National Library authority record lists his occupation as general."
